# State

Generated a reusable AI Wiki skill for importing external skill repositories as review-only candidates.

# Source Lessons

Built from the `codecoincognition/vibe-guard-skills` import workflow.

# Decisions

- Install this helper skill under `04_skills/generated`, not `04_skills/universal`.
- Stage external skills under `04_skills/candidates`.
- Preserve both adapted candidates and original upstream snapshots.
- Use `03_indexes/skills/external-sources/external-candidate-skills.json` as the global external candidate index.
- Default to dry-run/apply split for scripts.

# Known Footguns Captured

- `tar -C` requires the destination directory to already exist.
- The external candidate index path includes `external-sources`.
- Re-running import scripts must not duplicate candidate rows.
- Candidate rows must include `source_slug`.

# Next Checkpoint

Install the package into the AI Wiki generated shelf, then consider whether `vibe-guard` alone should be promoted to `04_skills/universal`.
